{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfP7yVTVRHZpeReZ96b7j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Marta climbed the two hundred steps each dusk, as her father had, and his father before him. The lamp was electric now, but she still polished the brass by hand.\n\nOne October night the fog came in thick. She sat by the window and watched the beam turn slowly through it. The beam showed nothing but white, yet she knew the ships could see it.\n\nNear midnight she heard a horn, faint and low. A fishing boat was lost somewhere close to the rocks. Marta could not signal with words, so she used the lamp. She switched it off for three seconds, then on for ten. She repeated this, again and again, until her hand ached.\n\nThe horn grew louder. At last a shape came out of the fog, slow and dark, and turned away from the rocks toward the harbor.\n\nIn the morning a young man climbed the stairs with a loaf of bread. He did not say much. He set the bread on her table and nodded once.\n\nMarta watched his boat leave. Then she took her cloth and began to polish the brass, as she did every morning."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15827,"cache_read_input_tokens":8253,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15827},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"947b3bd6-02a4-4321-ad45-179a811c040f","uuid":"a9e8d6db-abe7-4969-964a-2a15db996f06","timestamp":"2026-09-24T23:20:01.467Z","request_id":"req_011CfP7yV1T5bQ7Vwah77BHn"}
